497	    /** Delete a DRAFT claim: it is DELETED, counts nowhere and cannot be edited, opened or voided;
498	     *  its status log gains a DELETED line and CLAIM_DELETED is written. Any other claim, one dated in
499	     *  a closed period, or one another user's editor locks, is refused. */
500	    @Transactional
