884	     *  none and gets none), loses any figure a statement bound it to (live again until its new person's
885	     *  next statement), and is listed as its new person's newest claim. Anyone else, a SETTLED or VOID
886	     *  claim, a correction (it names a claim of its own person), a claim dated in a closed period, or
887	     *  a move to the same person or to one retired before the claim's date, is refused. */
