32	     *  the row's retire would, each followed by the figures it moved. Refused as a whole, writing nothing,
33	     *  when any selected person is not on the sheet. A viewer, or anyone on an archived sheet, retires
34	     *  no one. */
35	    @Transactional
36	    public List<Person> retire(String sheetId, String user, Set<Long> ids, LocalDate from) {
